1. Glyphicon o‘zi nima?
Glyphicon → Bootstrap ichidagi tayyor ikonka
✉ → email
🔍 → search
🖨 → print
⬇ → download
2. Glyphicon Syntax

Asosiy yozilishi:
<span class="glyphicon glyphicon-name"></span>
name o‘rniga kerakli icon nomi yoziladi.
3. Envelope — Email icon
<p>
    Envelope:
    <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-envelope"></span>
</p>
glyphicon-envelope → envelope/email icon.
4. Search icon
<p>
    Search:
    <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-search"></span>
</p>
5. Icon + Button
<button type="button" class="btn btn-default">
    <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-search"></span>
    Search
</button>
glyphicon-search → 🔍 icon
btn              → button style
btn-default      → default button
6. Styled Button + Icon
<button type="button" class="btn btn-info">
    <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-search"></span>
    Search
</button>
7. Print icon
<p>
    Print:
    <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-print"></span>
</p>
8. Icon + Link Button
<a href="#" class="btn btn-success btn-lg">
    <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-print"></span>
    Print
</a>
glyphicon                    → icon tizimi
glyphicon-envelope           → email icon
glyphicon-search             → search icon
glyphicon-print              → print icon
